request.description:
The `POST /trade/upload_trade_images` endpoint is used to upload images related to a trade. The request should be sent as a form-data with the following parameters:

- `id` (text): The ID of the trade.
- `packaging[]` (file): An array of packaging images.

The response to the request will have a status code of 200 and will include the following structure:

```json
{
    "success": null,
    "data": {
        "uploaded_image": {
            "product": [""],
            "packaging": [""],
            "certificate": [""],
            "sample_product": [""]
        }
    },
    "message": null,
    "error": []
}
```

The `uploaded_image` object contains arrays for different types of images such as product, packaging, certificate, and sample product. The response does not provide specific image URLs but indicates the success of the image upload operation.
